        "original_id": "eb50615c-f414-54f7-97de-75a4916586de",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Dias De Garage\n- Products: \"Listen Without Distraction\"\n- People: Josh Homme, John Garcia, Brant Bjork, Chris Cockrell\n- Organizations: Kyuss\n- Places: Palm Desert, California\n\nFacts:\n- Kyuss was an American rock band formed in 1987 in Palm Desert, California.\n- Kyuss was formed by Josh Homme on guitar, John Garcia on vocals, Brant Bjork on drums, and Chris Cockrell on bass.\n- In July 2004, Argentinean label Dias De Garage released \"Listen Without Distraction,\" the first-ever tribute to Kyuss.\n- \"Listen Without Distraction\" was named after the instructions Kyuss used to give music fans on their albums.",
